    "chunk_text": "NOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO LAND PARCELS Registration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998 (Section 12) NOTICE No. : 61/0382 KEGALLE DISTRICT It is hereby notified that any person having a claim to the ownership or possession or interest to one or more of the parcels of lands reflected in the Cadastral Map No. 610181 made by the Surveyor-General under Section 11 of the Registration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998 relating to the village of Yatathtawala (Block 03, Sheet No. 03) or any part thereof, situated within the Grama Niladhari Division of No.75C - Imbulgasdeniya in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Rambukkana in the District of Kegalle in the Province of Sabaragamuwa should submit his claim to the undersigned before 01st of August 2025 In the event of failure to submit any claim before the above-mentioned date, action will be taken to hold an ex parte inquiry to determine title to the land and accordingly publish such determination in the Government Gazette in terms of Section 14 of the above Act. The Cadastral Map No. 610181 referred to above may be perused at the relevant Grama Niladhari Office, Divisional Secretary's, District Survey Office, Office of the Commissioner of Title Settlement, or the Surveyor - General\u2019s Office. Further information may be obtained from the Grama Niladhari, the Divisional Secretary, or the Commissioner of Title Settlement. P.C.D. SIGERA, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No.1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla, 01st July, 2025. EOG 07 - 0157/11\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA. PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
