    "chunk_text": "1AI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.07.14PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 14.07.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2445/06 \u2013 2025 \u0152\u0263 \u0db8\u0dc3 14 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0dc3\u01ff\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.07.14\n\nNo. 2445/06 \u2013 MONDAY, JULY 14, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I: SECTION (I) \u2013 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Noti\ufb01cations\n\nNATIONAL WATER SUPPLY AND DRAINAGE BOARD ACT, No. 02 OF 1974\n\nOrder under Section 92\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me, under Section 92 of the National Water Supply and Drainage Board Act, No. 02 of 1974, I, Anura Karunathilaka, Minister of Urban Development, Construction and Housing, do hereby approve the acquisition of the immobile properties of the allotments of land described in the following schedule, as it is required by the said Board, for the construction of Kotawera Udagama Pump House under Yahalarawa Water Supply Project.\n\nANURA KARUNATHILAKA, Minister of Urban Development, Construction and Housing.\n\nRef. No.: MUDH/WS/LA/04/553.Ministry of Urban Development, Construction and Housing,12th Floor, \u2018Sethsiripaya\u2019, Stage II,Battaramulla.02nd July, 2025.\n\n1A \u2013 G 044824 \u2013 08 (07/2025)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.07.14\n\nPART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 14.07.2025 2A\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nAll that allotment of land called \u201cGala Peralena Ella alias Niththamaluwa Hena\u201d in total extent of about 10 Perches, situated in the village of Kotawera Udagama in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 53 E of Kotawera Udagama in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Uva Paranagama in Badulla District and bounded as follows:\n\nNorth by : Earth Road;East by : Mr. W. M. Nandasena\u2019s land;South and West by : Mr. M. M. Ajantha Kumara\u2019s land."
