    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2025'07'14Part I : Sec. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 14.07.2025\n\n3A\n\nSCHEDULE II\n\nRationale for the consideration of the Primary Business of Strategic Importance\n\nICC Port City (Private) Limited. is a company established by the International Construction Consortium (Private) Limited (ICC), a recognized leader in Sri Lanka\u2019s construction industry with the aim of investing in premier residential development within the Colombo Port City (CPC). ICC is a distinguished tier one general contract and property developer with a strong legacy in delivering high-quality construction and real estate projects with over 40 years of experience in executing a range of projects including residential, commercial, industrial and civil engineering work.\n\nThe primary goal of this establishment is to develop a luxury residential project within the CPC on plot 1-02-05 spanning an area of 13,945 sqm. The proposed development will feature two luxury apartment towers housing high end residential units and five luxury villas with state-of-the-art facilities offered to residents.\n\nICC Port City (Private) Limited. seeks to carry out the objectives of residential development, driving investment in the CPC, expansion of ICC's existing project portfolio, catering to international markets, conduct sales and marketing activities to sell apartments and to engage with foreign investors with the goal of attracting required foreign investment. ICC Port City (Private) Limited. will also offer the core services of luxury apartments, luxury villas and commercial space for sale or rent as well as serviced apartments and management services extending to rental management services and condominium management services."
