    "chunk_text": "4 A III \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.07.12 P\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRA ORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 12.07.2025\n\nNOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO LAND PARCELS Registration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998 (Section 12) NOTICE No.: 71/0201 BADULLA DISTRICT\n\nRegistration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998 (Section 12) NOTICE No.: 81/0464 GALLE DISTRICT\n\nIT is hereby notified that any person having a claim to the owner-ship or possession or interest to one or more of the parcels of lands reflected in the Cadastral Map No. 810083 made by the Surveyor-General under Section 11 of the Registration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998 relating to the village of Uduwaragoda (Block 02, Sheet No. 01) or any part thereof, situated within the Grama Niladhari Division of No.71A Uduwaragoda North in the Divisional Secretariat Division of Hikkaduwa in the District of Galle in the Province of Southern should submit his claim to the undersigned before 1st of August 2025 In the event of failure to submit any claim before the above-mentioned date, action will be taken to hold an ex parte inquiry to determine title to the land and accordingly publish such determination in the Government Gazette in terms of Section 14 of the above Act."
