    "chunk_text": "N.B.\u2013 This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 044822 - 04 (07/2025)\n\nPART III - LANDS\n\nTitle Registration\n\nNOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO LAND PARCELS\n\nRegistration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998\n\n(Section 12)\n\nNOTICE No.: 12/0530 POLONNARUWA DISTRICT\n\nIT is hereby notified that any person having a claim to the ownership or possession or interest to one or more of the parcels of lands reflected in the Cadastral Map No. 120139 made by the Surveyor-General under Section 11 of the Registration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998 relating to the village of Pasiyawewa (Block 08, Sheet No. 01) or any part thereof, situated within the Grama Niladhari Division of No.65 - Pasiyawewa in the Divisional Secretariat Division of Hingurakgoda in the District of Polonnaruwa in the Province of North Central should submit his claim to the undersigned before 1st of August 2025 In the event of failure to submit any claim before the above-mentioned date, action will be taken to hold an ex parte inquiry to determine title to the land and accordingly publish such determination in the Government Gazette in terms of Section 14 of the above Act. The Cadastral Map No. 120139 referred to above may be perused at the relevant Grama Niladhari Office, Divisional Secretariat, District Survey Office, Office of the Commissioner of Title Settlement, or the Surveyor - General\u2019s office. Further information may be obtained from the Grama Niladhari, the Divisional Secretary, or the Commissioner of Title Settlement. P.C.D. Sigera, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 01st July, 2025 EOG 07 - 0144/1\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbc\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc0\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc0\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dbe\u0dbf EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2444/75 - 2025 \u0da2\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc0 12 \u0dbd\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dba\u0dc0\u0db1\u0dc3\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.07.12\n\nNo. 2444/75 \u2013 SATURDAY, JULY 12, 2025"
