om the Grama Niladhari, the Divisional Secretary, or the Commissioner of Title Settlement.\n\nP.C.D. Sigera, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement.\n\nLand Title Settlement Department, No.1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla 01st July, 2025 EOG 07 - 0144/2\n\n_______________________\n\nNOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO\n\nLAND PARCELS\n\nRegistration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998\n\n(Section 12)\n\nNOTICE No.: 12/0529 POLONNARUWA DISTRICT"
