    "chunk_text": "Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hw;s \u00fafYIThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2013 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nLocal Government Notifications\n\nwxl 2444$62 \u2013 2025 cQ,s ui 11 jeks isl=rdod \u2013 2025'07'11No. 2444/62 \u2013 FRIDAY, JULY 11, 2025\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A \u2013 PG7205\u2013 05(07/2025)\n\nARANAYAKA PRADESHIYA SABHA\n\nTHE Hon. Governor of Sabaragamuwa Province, in accordance with the provisions of the series of regulations regarding the preparation of plans and publication of notices indicating the names of the roads and narrow roads maintained by the Pradeshiya Sabhas in the Sabaragamuwa Province Published in the special Gazette No. 2316/20 and the order made under Section 24 of the Pradeshiya Sabha Act, No. 15 of 1987 dated 17.01.2025 and the annexure included in the notification published in the Gazette No. 2419/18 has decided that all the roads and narrow roads in the Sabaragamuwa Province should be owned by the Aranayaka Pradeshiya Sabha as no case has been filed in the competent court on the date hereby announced for the public's information that the decision has been made.\n\nIt is further notifiedthat a list of the said roads and narrow roads in included in the Schedule hereto and that each road and narrow road included therein shall be deemed to be the roads and narrow roads vested in the Aranayaka Pradeshiya Sabha under Sub section (5) of the Pradeshiya Sabha Act.\n\nP.G.U. Jayawickrama , Secretary and Power and Activity Implementing Offic Aranayaka Pradeshiya Sabha. Aranayaka Pradeshiya Sabha,19th of June, 2025.\n\nIV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2025'07'11Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 11.07.2025\n\n2A\n\nSerial\n\nN